<figure id="S6.T3" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>. </span><span id="S6.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Moderated mediation results with the moderator W (Autonomy).
We focus on <em id="S6.T3.5.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Intermediate Autonomy</em> and report the index of moderated mediation (MM) and the conditional effects when IA = 0 (No autonomy) and IA = 1 (Intermediate autonomy).
We do not display IA = 2 (Full autonomy) because the mixed-effects models <a href="#S5.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 5.1. Linear Regression Analysis ‣ 5. Results (H1-H4): Effects of Personalization Types and Autonomy Levels of LLM Agent and Individual Differences on Privacy Concern, Trust and Willingness to Use ‣ Autonomy Matters: A Study on Personalization-Privacy Dilemma in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 1</span></a> did not show significant full-autonomy effects on the outcomes; detailed full-autonomy estimates are provided in the supplement.
For example, the MM index for “No personalization <math id="S6.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> M2 <math id="S6.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Privacy concern” shows how the indirect effect via a mediator changes between IA = 0 and IA = 1.
Direct effects (<math id="S6.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X\rightarrow Y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\rightarrow Y</annotation></semantics></math>) do not have an MM index. Significant results are bold (95% CI excludes 0).</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
