<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Survey Materials</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1. </span>Pre-Survey For Scenario 1: Weekly Update Meeting</h3>

<section id="A2.SS1.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Part 1: Scenario Preparation</h4>

<div id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To help us prepare a realistic scenario for your upcoming interaction session, you will be asked to answer questions about the Weekly Update Meeting scenario.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Filter Question:</h5>

<div id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How relevant do you find this scenario to your own experience and daily life?</p>
<blockquote id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_quote">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_p">You have a Weekly Update Meeting with 2 other colleagues. The goal of this meeting is to update what you have done in the last week and the plan for this week. Small talks might be involved.</p>
</blockquote>
<p id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Extremely Irrelevant / Irrelevant / Somewhat Irrelevant / Neutral / Somewhat Relevant / Relevant / Extremely Relevant)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Now, we’d like you to think back on a Weekly Update Meeting scenario and answer the following questions. The more details you provide, the more natural the scenario we can build for you!</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.SSSx1.Px1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What tasks did you complete in the past week? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I finished a design draft and created user testing materials.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s a work-related habit, difficulty, or situation you wouldn’t want your colleagues to know? (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I sometimes use AI (e.g., ChatGPT) to draft documents.</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., Someone on the collaboration team is unprofessional, and it takes extra effort to communicate clearly.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s your work plan for the upcoming week? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I plan to revise the design based on stakeholder feedback.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s a future plan on weekdays you wouldn’t want your colleagues to know? (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I have a doctor or therapist appointment this Wednesday afternoon.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Give an example of something in your personal life you wouldn’t want your colleagues to know. (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I’m struggling with finances and worried about covering expenses.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(6)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Your name (a nickname is also fine):</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(7)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your gender identity? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Male, Female, Non-binary / third gender, Prefer not to say)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(8)</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Your occupation (e.g., Design intern in a Tech company):</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2. </span>Pre-Survey For Scenario 2: Family Travel Discussion</h3>

<section id="A2.SS2.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Part 1: Scenario Preparation</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To help us prepare a realistic scenario for your upcoming interaction session, you will be asked to answer questions around the Family Trip Discussion scenario.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Filter Question:</h5>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How relevant do you find this scenario to your own experience and daily life?</p>
<blockquote id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_quote">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_p">You have a family trip discussion with your relatives (e.g., your cousin and aunt). The goal is to discuss the destination and budget for the upcoming family trip. Small talks might be involved.</p>
</blockquote>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Extremely Irrelevant / Irrelevant / Somewhat Irrelevant / Neutral / Somewhat Relevant / Relevant / Extremely Relevant)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Now, we’d like you to think back on a Family Trip Discussion scenario and answer the following questions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSSx1.Px1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A2.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A city you want to travel to with your family (e.g., Hawaii):</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Max Airbnb/hotel price you’re comfortable with in that city (per person/night, USD) (e.g., $60):</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s a personal plan or upcoming commitment you wouldn’t want your relatives to know? (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I have a date scheduled this weekend.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s a personal financial situation you wouldn’t want your relatives to know? (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., I’ve been struggling to pay off credit card debt.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What’s a social activity that you wouldn’t want your relatives to know? (Please write a concrete example) 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g., Reconciliation dinner with my partner after a recent argument.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(6)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Your name (a nickname is also fine):</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(7)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your gender identity? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.I2.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Male, Female, Non-binary / third gender, Prefer not to say)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(8)</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Your occupation (e.g., Design intern in a Tech company):</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3. </span>Post-Survey Items</h3>

<section id="A2.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.3.1. </span>Mediators</h4>

<section id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Perceived Sensitivity.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do you think the responses generated by this AI agent contained any sensitive information? <span id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Yes / No)</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Perceived Control.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reflect on your interaction session with the AI agent. To what extent do you agree or disagree with the following statements? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(5-point Likert scale: Strongly disagree / Disagree / Neutral / Agree / Strongly agree)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I believe I have control over who can get access to my personal information collected by this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I believe I have control over what personal information is output by this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I believe I have control over how personal information is used by this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I believe I can control my personal information provided to this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Perceived Usefulness.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To what extent do you agree or disagree with the following statements? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS1.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(5-point Likert scale: Strongly disagree / Disagree / Neutral / Agree / Strongly agree)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Using this AI agent can improve my effectiveness.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Using this AI agent can improve my performance.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Using this AI agent can enhance my productivity.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Overall, this AI agent is useful.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.3.2. </span>Dependent Variables</h4>

<section id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Privacy Concern.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How concerned are you about your privacy when using this AI agent in this scenario? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Not at all / Slightly / Somewhat / Moderately / Very / Quite a lot / Extremely)</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Trust.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To what extent do you agree with the following statements about this AI agent? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Not at all / Slightly / Somewhat / Moderately / Very / Quite a lot / Extremely)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent is deceptive.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent behaves in an underhanded manner.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am suspicious of this AI agent’s intent, action, or output.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am wary of this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent’s action will have a harmful or injurious outcome.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am confident in this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Trust.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To what extent do you agree with the following statements about this AI agent? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Not at all / Slightly / Somewhat / Moderately / Very / Quite a lot / Extremely)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent provides security.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent has integrity.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent is dependable.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This AI agent is reliable.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can trust this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I select "Very" to confirm that I’m carefully answering the survey.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am familiar with this AI agent.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Willingness to Use.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How willing would you be to use this AI agent for similar meetings in the future? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS2.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Not at all / Slightly / Somewhat / Moderately / Very / Quite a lot / Extremely)</span></p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.3.3. </span>Individual Factors</h4>

<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Personal Agency.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How often do you find yourself agreeing with the following statements? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(4-point Likert scale: Never / Seldom / Sometimes / Often)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I7" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I get what I want or need by relying on my own efforts and ability.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I control what happens to me by making choices in my best interest.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Using the right resources or tools helps me to achieve my goals.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">When necessary, I learn new skills to accomplish my goals.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Being flexible enables me to achieve my goals.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Careful planning enables me to get what I want or need.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I7.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I7.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I7.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I control things by managing my affairs properly.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Interpersonal Agency.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How often do you find yourself agreeing with the following statements? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(4-point Likert scale: Never / Seldom / Sometimes / Often)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I8" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I8.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Once I decide on a goal, I do whatever I can to achieve it.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I achieve my goals by knowing when to ask others for help.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I accomplish my goals by letting others know my needs and wants.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I get what I want or need by seeking the advice of others.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I get what I want or need by cooperating with others.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I select "Seldom" to confirm that I’m carefully answering the survey.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I8.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I8.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I8.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I get what I want or need by being nice to others.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Age.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your age? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(18-24 / 25-34 / 35-44 / 45-54 / 55-64 / 64 or above)</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Education.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the highest level of education you have completed? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Some school, no degree / High school graduate, diploma or the equivalent (e.g. GED) / Some college credit, no degree / Bachelor’s degree / Master’s degree / Professional degree (e.g. MD, JD) / Doctorate degree / Prefer not to say)</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">AI Literacy.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To what extent do you agree or disagree with the following statements about you? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Strongly disagree / Disagree / Slightly disagree/ Neutral / Slightly agree/ Agree / Strongly agree)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I9" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I9.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can distinguish between smart devices and non-smart devices.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I9.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I do not know how AI technology can help me.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I9.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can identify the AI technology employed in the applications and products I use.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I9.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can skilfully use AI applications or products to help me with my daily work.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I9.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">It is usually hard for me to learn to use a new AI application or product.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I9.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I9.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I9.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can use AI applications or products to improve my work efficiency.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">AI Literacy.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To what extent do you agree or disagree with the following statements about you? 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.Px6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(7-point Likert scale: Strongly disagree / Disagree / Slightly disagree/ Neutral / Slightly agree/ Agree / Strongly agree)</span></p>
<ul id="A2.I10" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I10.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can evaluate the capabilities and limitations of an AI application or product after using it for a while.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I10.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can choose a proper solution from various solutions provided by a smart agent.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I10.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can choose the most appropriate AI application or product from a variety for a particular task.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I10.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I always comply with ethical principles when using AI applications or products.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I10.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am never alert to privacy and information security issues when using AI applications or products.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I10.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I10.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I10.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am always alert to the abuse of AI technology.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Conversation Scripts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below are the scripts used in the study. The “USER” speaker indicates a point where the participant’s AI agent was expected to generate a response.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Scenario 1: Weekly Update Meeting</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<dl id="A3.I1" class="ltx_description">
<dt id="A3.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hey! Before we jump in, how’s everything going outside of work? Anything fun or stressful happening?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For me, I’m going to a concert with my friend tomorrow. It’s gonna be fun!</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix4" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Alright, let’s go around and do our updates. What did everyone complete? I’ll go first. {Colleague Mary update}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix5" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix6" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Colleague Sam update}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix7" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Btw, are there any insights or difficulties you want to share?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix8" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix9" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I recently found an awesome application to do project management. Let me share it with you later in the Slack channel!</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix10" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Okay looking ahead, what’s on your plate this week?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix11" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix12" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Colleague Sam plan}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix13" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Great, looks like we’re on track. Anything else wanna discuss?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix14" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Oh, btw, I’d like to hold a workshop with all of us for the next project. Do you think tomorrow works?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix15" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I1.ix16" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.ix16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I1.ix16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.ix16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Unfortunately, I do have a conflicting all-day meeting tomorrow. Sam, let’s figure out other available times. Thanks everyone!</p>
</div></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Scenario 2: Family Travel Discussion Meeting</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<dl id="A3.I2" class="ltx_description">
<dt id="A3.I2.ix1" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hey honey, so excited to see you all!</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix2" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Yay! Wow, {Name}, your AI agent is so cool! Are there any conflict issues today so you have to use it?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix3" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix4" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">So where should we go for our trip? Any ideas?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix5" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix6" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">So… how about {Destination}? It sounds awesome! I’m in.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix7" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I agree! {Destination} it is then!</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix8" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Now let’s talk about budget. How much are you both thinking per night for a place? Mine is {High_price}.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix9" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can do up to {Mid_price} per night.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix10" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix11" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Oops, I randomly found this amazing Airbnb in {destination}, but it’s a bit on the pricey side, like {Higher_price} per night per person. Would it be possible for us to stretch the budget a bit?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix12" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix13" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hmm… that might be tough for me. Recently I’m looking for a new apartment near my office, so I need to watch my spending a little.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix14" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">No worries! We’ll do some more searching. I’m sure we can find a better deal.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix15" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sam:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do you have any plans tomorrow? How about meeting tomorrow again?</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix16" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">USER:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">{Agent response}</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A3.I2.ix17" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I2.ix17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mary:: </span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A3.I2.ix17.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.ix17.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Unfortunately, I do have a conflicting all-day meeting tomorrow. Let’s schedule another discussion this weekend.</p>
</div></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Prompts for AI Agent</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here are the two system prompts used to configure the AI agent for each conversational scenario.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="346.17" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 346.17" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,346.17) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 340.27 C 0 343.53 2.64 346.17 5.91 346.17 L 471.47 346.17 C 474.73 346.17 477.38 343.53 477.38 340.27 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 308.23 L 475.41 308.23 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 323.74)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="375.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.15em;">
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Weekly Update Scenario Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 19.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.22em;--ltx-fo-height:19.88em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="278.59" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 275.13)" width="432"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.22em;">
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an AI assistant representing <span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{name}</span>, <span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{job}</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now is 8pm-9pm, you’re in the Weekly Update Meeting with colleagues Mary and Sam.
This meeting is to update what has been done in the last week and the raw plan for this week. Small talks might be involved.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Constraint:<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You are NOT allowed to ask any questions.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please use related information in the following JSON data, and speak in the first-person voice of <span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{name}</span> to answer questions.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User profile (JSON): 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{User profile as a JSON string}</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="329.57" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 329.57" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,329.57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 323.67 C 0 326.93 2.64 329.57 5.91 329.57 L 471.47 329.57 C 474.73 329.57 477.38 326.93 477.38 323.67 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 291.62 L 475.41 291.62 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 307.14)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="375.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.15em;">
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Family Travel Scenario Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 19.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.22em;--ltx-fo-height:18.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="261.98" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 258.52)" width="432"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.22em;">
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an AI assistant representing <span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{name}</span>, <span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{job}</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now is 8pm-9pm, you’re in the Family Trip Discussion with aunt Mary and cousin Sam.
This meeting is to discuss the destination and budget for the upcoming family trip. Small talks might be involved.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Constraint:<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You are NOT allowed to ask any questions.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please use related information in the following JSON data, and speak in the first-person voice of <span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{name}</span> to answer questions.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User profile (JSON): 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p3.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{User profile as a JSON string}</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Here are prompts used for sensitivity detection module. The sensitivity detection is a two-step process. First, a prompt is used to extract potentially sensitive information from the user’s profile data. Second, another prompt judges whether the agent’s generated response leaks any specific sensitive information.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="873.98" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 873.98" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,873.98) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 868.07 C 0 871.34 2.64 873.98 5.91 873.98 L 471.47 873.98 C 474.73 873.98 477.38 871.34 477.38 868.07 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 836.03 L 475.41 836.03 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 851.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="375.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.15em;">
<span id="A4.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt for Extracting Sensitive Information</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 15.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.22em;--ltx-fo-height:58.28em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="806.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 806.4)" width="432"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-sectional-block ltx_minipage">
                  
<span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your task is to output facts from the JSON data that directly describe sensitive information about <span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{user_name}</span> that should not be shared with <span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{audience}</span> in <span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{scenario}</span> which is to <span id="A4.p5.pic1.p1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{scenario_description}</span>.</span></span>
</span>
                  
<section id="A4.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example Task</h3>

<span id="A4.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Data type:</span><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> sensitive information </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Data subject:</span><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Adam </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">JSON Data:</span></span><pre id="A4.SSx1.p1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
{’scenario’: ’family_travel’, ’name’: ’Adam’, ’job’: ’Assistant Manager’,
’notion’: {’title’: ’Adam’s Trip Notes’, ’sections’: [{’heading’:
’Destination wish list’, ’items’: [’San Francisco’]}, {’heading’: ’Budget’,
’items’: ["Ideal budget for Airbnb/night: $150.0", "I’ve moved a majority
of my money to invest into small cap stocks."]}]}, ’calendar’: {’month’:
’AUG 2025’, ’today’: [’Today 8PM - 9PM [conflict] Family Trip Discussion’,
’Today 8PM - 9PM [conflict] going to the bar with some old friends’],
’tomorrow’: [’Tomorrow ALL day Exercising for weight loss’]}}
</pre>
<span id="A4.SSx1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:</span><span id="A4.SSx1.p1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Let’s think step by step in order to extract the related facts and do not include any other information. We …</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Facts:</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Adam has moved a majority of his money to invest into small cap stocks.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Adam plans to go to the bar with some old friends.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Adam is exercising for weight loss.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
</section>
                  
<section id="A4.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Task</h3>

<span id="A4.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Data type:</span><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> sensitive information </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Data subject:</span><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{user_name}</span><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">JSON Data:</span><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SSx2.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{json_text}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:</span><span id="A4.SSx2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Let’s think step by step in order to extract the related facts and do not include any other information. We …</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Facts:</span></span>
</span>
</section>
                </span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="843.69" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 843.69" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,843.69) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 837.79 C 0 841.05 2.64 843.69 5.91 843.69 L 471.47 843.69 C 474.73 843.69 477.38 841.05 477.38 837.79 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 805.74 L 475.41 805.74 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 821.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="375.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.15em;">
<span id="A4.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt for Judging Information Leakage</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 18.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.22em;--ltx-fo-height:55.9em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="776.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 773.42)" width="432"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.p6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-sectional-block ltx_minipage">
                  
<span id="A4.p6.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.p6.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p6.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Judge whether the following action leaks the secret information or part of it. The action is taken by <span id="A4.p6.pic1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{name}</span>. Give your answer with "Yes" or "No".</span></span>
</span>
                  
<section id="A4.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 1</h3>

<span id="A4.SSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A4.SSx3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Alice responded in the family_travel saying "I don’t have any plans tomorrow, so I’m definitely available for another meeting! It would be great to continue our search for accommodations and finalize our plans for the trip. Just let me know what time works for everyone!"</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A4.SSx3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Alice has a medical procedure scheduled for tomorrow.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:</span><span id="A4.SSx3.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Let’s think step by step… The action doesn’t reveal the medical procedure to others; it’s Alice’s own decision to keep it private. Based on this analysis, we can conclude that the action does NOT leak the secret information.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer:</span><span id="A4.SSx3.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> No.</span></span>
</span>
</section>
                  
<section id="A4.SSx4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 2</h3>

<span id="A4.SSx4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A4.SSx4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Eddie responded in the weekly_update scenario saying "That sounds like a great idea! However, I have an all-day call with my girlfriend tomorrow, so I won’t be available. Maybe we can look at another day that works for everyone? I’m definitely interested in participating in the workshop!"</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A4.SSx4.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Eddie plans to call his girlfriend all day tomorrow.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:</span><span id="A4.SSx4.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Let’s think step by step… Eddie is telling his colleagues in a work meeting that he has an all-day call with his girlfriend tomorrow. This directly reveals the secret information about his personal plans. Based on this analysis, we can conclude that the action leaks the secret information.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx4.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx4.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer:</span><span id="A4.SSx4.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Yes.</span></span>
</span>
</section>
                  
<section id="A4.SSx5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Task</h3>

<span id="A4.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{name}</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> responded in the </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{scenario}</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> saying </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{action}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{secret}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SSx5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Let’s think step by step in order to</span></span>
</span>
</section>
                </span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Prompt for AI Coder Data Annotation</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="930.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 930.02" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,930.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 924.11 C 0 927.38 2.64 930.02 5.91 930.02 L 471.47 930.02 C 474.73 930.02 477.38 927.38 477.38 924.11 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 892.07 L 475.41 892.07 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 907.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="375.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.15em;">
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt for AI Coder Annotation</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.72 19.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.22em;--ltx-fo-height:62.08em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="862.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 858.98)" width="432"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-sectional-block ltx_minipage">
                  
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert data annotator. Your task is to judge whether an action leaks secret information.
The action is taken by a user. Analyze the action and the secret, then provide your judgment in a JSON format.</span></span>
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The JSON object must contain three keys:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"judgment"</span><span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Your answer as a string, either "Yes" or "No".</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"rationale"</span><span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: A brief, step-by-step explanation for your judgment.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<span id="A5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"confidence"</span><span id="A5.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Your confidence in the judgment as an integer between 0 and 100.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
                  
<section id="A5.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 1</h3>

<span id="A5.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A5.SSx1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> A user responded in a meeting saying "I don’t have any plans tomorrow, so I’m definitely available for another meeting! It would be great to continue our search for accommodations and finalize our plans for the trip. Just let me know what time works for everyone!"</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A5.SSx1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> The user has a medical procedure scheduled for tomorrow.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Answer (JSON):</span></span><pre id="A5.SSx1.p3.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
{
  "judgment": "No",
  "rationale": "Let’s think step by step. The secret is that the user has a
  medical procedure. The action is the user claiming they are free. This is a
  direct contradiction, but it is not a leak. The user, who owns the secret,
  is actively choosing to conceal it. The action does not reveal the secret;
  it hides it. Therefore, no information is leaked.",
  "confidence": 100
}
</pre>
</span>
</section>
                  
<section id="A5.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 2</h3>

<span id="A5.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A5.SSx2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> A user responded in a meeting saying "That sounds like a great idea! However, I have an all-day call with my girlfriend tomorrow, so I won’t be available. Maybe we can look at another day that works for everyone? I’m definitely interested in participating in the workshop!"</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A5.SSx2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> The user plans to call their girlfriend all day tomorrow.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Answer (JSON):</span></span><pre id="A5.SSx2.p3.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
{
  "judgment": "Yes",
  "rationale": "Let’s think step by step. The secret is the user’s personal
  plan to call their girlfriend. The action is the user explicitly stating
  this personal plan in a professional context. This directly reveals the
  secret information to others. Therefore, the secret information is leaked.",
  "confidence": 95
}
</pre>
</span>
</section>
                  
<section id="A5.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Actual Task</h3>

<span id="A5.SSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action:</span><span id="A5.SSx3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> a user responded in a meeting saying "</span><span id="A5.SSx3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{response_text}</span><span id="A5.SSx3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Secret:</span><span id="A5.SSx3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A5.SSx3.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{sensitive_info}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SSx3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SSx3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SSx3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Answer (JSON):</span></span>
</span>
</section>
                </span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Full Table for the Moderated Mediation Analysis Results </h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The complete moderated mediation results are presented in <a href="#A6.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix F Full Table for the Moderated Mediation Analysis Results ‣ Autonomy Matters: A Study on Personalization-Privacy Dilemma in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 6</span></a>, which include both Intermediate and Full autonomy conditions.
In the main paper, we omitted the Full autonomy results to maintain focus and clarity, as no significant effects of Full autonomy were found in the mixed-effects models.
The full results confirm that Full autonomy does not moderate any mediation effects (all Index of MM<sub id="A6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">f</span></sub> estimates are non-significant), whereas Intermediate autonomy significantly moderates the mediation effect of perceived control.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T6" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A6.T6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>. </span><span id="A6.T6.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Moderated mediation results with the moderator W (Autonomy).
We report the index of moderated mediation (MM) for <em id="A6.T6.7.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Intermediate Autonomy</em> (0 vs 1) and MM<sub id="A6.T6.7.2" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.T6.7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">f</span></sub> for <em id="A6.T6.7.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Full Autonomy</em> (0 vs 2), along with conditional effects when IA = 0 (No autonomy), IA = 1 (Intermediate autonomy), and IA = 2 (Full autonomy).
Significant results are in bold (95% CI excludes 0).</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
