<p id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Notes.</span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> M1 = perceived sensitivity, M2 = perceived control, M3 = perceived usefulness.
