Index of MM compares IA=0 vs IA=1; Index of MM</span><sub id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">f</span></sub><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> compares IA=0 vs IA=2.</span></p>
